      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive 4 bed detached residence with attached garage and detached sun room on an elevated plot. Boasting a bright contemporary finish with patio, gardens and private parking. Superbly situated just off Skibbereen town centre adjacent Skibbereen Community School.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, mains services, fibre broadband"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 6.3m x 2.0m \r\nTiled floor, staircase, understairs storage\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 5.4m x 4.2m \r\nWooden floor, insert stove with wooden surround\r\n\r\nDining Area - 5.4m x 4.2m \r\nWooden floor, wood pellet boiler, open to kitchen\r\n\r\nKitchen Area - 4.8m x 3.1m \r\nWooden floor, modern painted wooden kitchen, electric oven, hob and extractor, integrated fridge freezer, integrated dishwasher, washing machine, dryer\r\n\r\nWashroom - 2.0m x 1.8m \r\nFully tiled, vanity unit, w.c heated towel rail\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.4m x 2.4m \r\nWooden floor, hotpress, stira stairs to attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.6m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe, full ensute\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.8m x 3.6m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 2.8m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.2m x 2.4m \r\nWooden floor\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.0m x 2.5m \r\nFully tiled, walk in shower, two vanity units, w.c. heated towel rail\r\n\r\n"
      },
